  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Project Owner Agent Directory",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "description": "Current Human Owner only, including initialized readable archived Projects under the original Project gate; no administrator bypass. Only initialized active Agents. No runtime/busy or capability grant. Fixed created_at DESC,id DESC signed pagination; every page reauthorizes, and traversal is not a snapshot. display_name=null falls back to name. Explicit nine-field projection excludes Model, Prompt, tools and Secret configuration. IDs, decimal-string Version, exact UTF-8 byte caps (display_name 1024, description 8192), Unicode/control checks, reserved names and updated_at>=created_at are additionally validated by Go. GET/HEAD accept no body or unknown/repeated query keys; only list accepts limit/cursor. Natural total read deadline 2s includes authentication, SQL and original I/O join; no automatic retry."
  },
